{"w":2400,"h":3106,"lines":[{"w":0.30147799173990875,"x":0.57483209896436516,"y":0.078346797213881381,"t":"Sample answers for Writing tasks","h":0.024431423916789097,"c":1},{"x":0.095634724445997299,"t":"TEST 3, WRITING TASK 2","c":1,"y":0.12461397135887908,"w":0.33502423604329429,"h":0.024182316570687257},{"y":0.16005298081524044,"w":0.1885846710205078,"h":0.01864119122585628,"x":0.09557431407989668,"c":1,"t":"SAMPLE ANSWER"},{"c":1,"y":0.19567999044613171,"w":0.74301483154296877,"x":0.095591686955611502,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.0 score. Here is the","h":0.026462943033487285},{"t":"examiner's comment:","c":1,"w":0.18984962463378907,"h":0.014595718899620636,"y":0.21656976752067114,"x":0.095864661069696946},{"y":0.25134358048029726,"h":0.023880331576139113,"w":0.71473393758138015,"c":1,"x":0.13699058257461039,"t":"The writer addresses all parts of the prompt and outlines why the various subjects"},{"h":0.025201091287370914,"t":"are all important, supporting these ideas with relevant examples. Although the","c":1,"x":0.13696033040045677,"w":0.68091669718424486,"y":0.26920875892163432},{"x":0.13697732260107273,"y":0.28722498906583316,"w":0.72037134806315106,"h":0.025009803747409132,"t":"organisation is sometimes confused, there is a sense of progression and a definite","c":1},{"t":"conclusion is reached. Cohesive devices are used effectively [\/n my opinion | Of","y":0.30158008409119863,"w":0.70165145874023427,"x":0.13692210018864265,"h":0.030266059880400986,"c":1},{"t":"course | especially]. Referencing is generally accurate [we wouldn't know that","y":0.32199052838332298,"x":0.13510618382002226,"c":1,"h":0.026554856849960284,"w":0.68093348185221358},{"t":"without them | these things | that hope | that is a reason why], but there is one error","h":0.024835882536918263,"c":1,"y":0.34061966786365483,"x":0.13511172332734739,"w":0.72787836710611975},{"c":1,"x":0.13323934020313213,"t":"[With this \/ these two things]. The range of vocabulary is quite varied [go along","y":0.35807845529300497,"w":0.68660639444986982,"h":0.025783094220674263},{"h":0.026473041050524726,"w":0.68856480916341145,"y":0.37665883205124029,"c":1,"t":"with today's world | to move forward | daily life | transportation, communication,","x":0.13504872006778526},{"y":0.39493997223327937,"c":1,"h":0.025943026570297345,"t":"collaboration etc. | political standing, culture and traditions], though errors occur","w":0.6978178405761718,"x":0.13322970217487504},{"t":"[every subjects \/ subject | normally \/ normal human beings | a bright chances \/","y":0.41333993893975363,"w":0.68654902140299479,"c":1,"x":0.13319087488398376,"h":0.023923835828084772},{"x":0.13321362116630286,"c":1,"y":0.4313790818937715,"w":0.68466746012369795,"h":0.024296014445563507,"t":"chance], while a reference to [stuff and things] suggests the writer struggled to"},{"y":0.44855965476078286,"x":0.13315280298118903,"w":0.69234980265299473,"h":0.025415037343061497,"c":1,"t":"find more precise terms. There is a mix of simple and complex sentence forms,"},{"c":1,"w":0.73170272827148441,"t":"including different types of subordinate clauses [Some people say that ... | ... which","h":0.025081285721090474,"x":0.13132753934902611,"y":0.46647314571081666},{"h":0.025686356150866008,"c":1,"y":0.48483672143262546,"t":"is science and technology | ... people who pushes \/ push us to | The \/ They taught","w":0.72225270589192703,"x":0.13129076226994338},{"w":0.72421503702799472,"x":0.1332023343278263,"c":1,"h":0.024454805824884018,"t":"us how to] and although errors occur, these do not usually cause misunderstanding","y":0.50326400298091079},{"w":0.72032328287760405,"c":1,"h":0.024604474354465777,"y":0.52103321466368391,"x":0.13138116447794707,"t":"or difficulty for the reader. Punctuation is sometimes faulty, particularly omission of"},{"t":"full stops.","y":0.53956804755759968,"w":0.087198352813720736,"x":0.13124633000280234,"h":0.015396398800999078,"c":1},{"t":"In my opinion I think every subjects is important for us. We have to learn everything through our","c":1,"x":0.086124490893458402,"y":0.56551147245018329,"h":0.028841673291581604,"w":0.75435557047526036},{"c":1,"x":0.086329327398464106,"t":"past, present and tuture. Some people say that History is one of the most important school subjects","y":0.58897992959152734,"w":0.76721715291341142,"h":0.022031705454711559},{"c":1,"y":0.60658480932676884,"t":"it's true but it has to go along with today's world which is science and Technology. How can we","x":0.088147784818769323,"w":0.72597991943359375,"h":0.025075618942860034},{"y":0.6255601346529952,"w":0.74863357543945308,"t":"move without our history, the people behind us \"The ancient people\" is the most powerful people","x":0.086206745349790212,"h":0.02973835067601649,"c":1},{"h":0.031086369629299337,"t":"who pushes us to move forward. The taught us how to fire a light, How to find a food, How to lives","y":0.64697639277236429,"x":0.086124860990399454,"w":0.75630172729492195,"c":1},{"w":0.75821350097656248,"c":1,"y":0.6669698419677591,"h":0.030327547003358601,"t":"with other and animals, How to survive and others. Of course we wouldn't know that without them.","x":0.086142821206931619},{"x":0.084223595666464063,"y":0.68929804037692755,"w":0.72626800537109371,"t":"Science and Technology are important too. They give us a chance to move forward with them.","h":0.029478848095640275,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.75236485799153652,"h":0.027051551067207358,"t":"Without Science and Technology we're just a normally humans being. We spend our daily life with","x":0.084337863646103989,"y":0.71068383192838158},{"w":0.77120213826497397,"x":0.084327456757860089,"t":"no useful. Without them we have no light we have no food, we have no comfortable stuff and things.","y":0.7318545222684476,"h":0.027109675459606963,"c":1},{"t":"Old people can survived without these things. Humans creates lots of invention to give an unlimited","h":0.030008781516621119,"w":0.76753768920898435,"x":0.084236814603556143,"y":0.750710237172032,"c":1},{"h":0.024194576167630433,"w":0.37473225911458341,"c":1,"y":0.77228914738831389,"t":"wants of people based on a limited government.","x":0.082417438211319471},{"x":0.08427316974903136,"t":"May I gives one example of the development of science and Technology. With this two things it","w":0.72986679077148442,"y":0.80066799359977847,"h":0.02822828937636146,"c":1},{"y":0.82249502797948415,"x":0.08259610394638088,"w":0.71828730265299479,"c":1,"h":0.022332200678563119,"t":"give us a chance to be a member of ASEAN \"Association of South East Asia Nation\" we can"},{"h":0.02709577993968959,"w":0.7318115234375,"x":0.080511125704642555,"y":0.84245819630694219,"c":1,"t":"be able to communicate with the other 9 countries with the high technology. it help us to be a"},{"t":"TEAMWORK with the 9 other countries to develop our country. help us in terms of transportation,","x":0.080489826792856239,"y":0.86072041208511885,"w":0.76581400553385415,"h":0.03041195301416999,"c":1},{"x":0.080586565361556853,"y":0.88415929816657268,"t":"communication, collaboration etc. it can definitely hold on to that hope that in the near future.","h":0.026179455513349215,"w":0.73547480265299481,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"131","w":0.033834587732950783,"h":0.013081395234588844,"x":0.81954887145307342,"y":0.96511627908601239}]}